{"base":"61789d223a33c9c623714481121714eec7de2a33","description":"- add `create [<revision>]` to open a release COB up front, so a script\n  can create once and register many artifacts with `--release <id>`\n- reuse your own release idempotently for the same commit and tag; treat\n  a different tag on the same commit as a distinct release and mint it\n  without prompting\n- print the release id on stdout (`--json` for `{release_id, oid}`)\n\nEnables the create-once/register-many flow for release scripts, replacing\nreliance on `register`'s lazy, prompt-driven release creation.","oid":"ff5965b94d77fc9e1001cfaa2622ce9348f32647","type":"revision"}